### Gasto válido
POST http://localhost:3000/api/movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "expense",
  "amount": 1525050,
  "date": "2026-10-05",
  "accountId": 1,
  "categoryId": 2
}

### Monto negativo (debe dar 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "expense",
  "amount": -500,
  "date": "2026-10-05",
  "accountId": 1,
  "categoryId": 2
}

### Fecha mal escrita y tipo inválido (debe dar 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/movements
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "gasto",
  "amount": 1000,
  "date": "05/10/2026",
  "accountId": 1
}